begin main ()
(2) := call test()
(5) := call test() // should fail here
end main()

begin test()
end test(2)

/*
The call statment (line 3) restores value 2 from subroutine 'test' and therefore must assert that 5 == 2 which is false.
Should fail with:

Failed assertion: Value 2 is not equals target 5.
	at Forward.main(../tests/rssa/vm/assertions/call-assert-constants.rssa:3)
*/
